-- by test a cover is judged as a sample, sequentially (QuickCheck's checkCoverage): more cases are drawn, trials at a
-- time, until a Wilson bound decides it: met if the low bound reaches 0.9 of the share, short if the high bound is under it
under test: number
let numerals = [0 .. 9]
law sampled_short: all n: number(n). n >= 0 by test classify zero when n = 0 cover 50% zero
law sampled_near: all n: number(n). n >= 0 by test classify zero when n = 0 cover 12% zero
law sampled_met: all n: number(n). n >= 0 by test classify zero when n = 0 cover 9% zero
